graph LR
    A[Bug Reported] --> B{Can Reproduce?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Minimize Test Case]
    B -->|No| D[Add Logging]
    
    C --> E{Obvious Cause?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Fix & Test]
    E -->|No| G[Choose Debug Tool]
    
    G --> H[printf debugging]
    G --> I[GDB breakpoints]
    G --> J[Valgrind memory]
    G --> K[strace syscalls]
    G --> L[Core dump analysis]
    
    H --> M[Isolate Problem]
    I --> M
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M
    
    M --> N[Understand Root Cause]
    N --> O[Implement Fix]
    O --> P[Write Test]
    P --> Q[Verify Fix]
    
    D --> R[Reproduce with logs]
    R --> C
    
    Q --> S{Fixed?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Done]
    S -->|No| G
    
    style M fill:#fff4e1
    style N fill:#e8f5e8
    style T fill:#d4edda
